/**
 * DashboardPageElement.ts — pages/client/dashboard/
 *
 * Full spec implementation (replaces Part 4's proof-of-concept).
 *
 * Composes:
 *   - PeriodSelectorElement (period filter)
 *   - KpiMetricPickerElement (metric selection with period-over-period deltas)
 *   - ChartWidgetElement (bar/line/area toggle + skeleton loading)
 *   - 5 ReportShortcutTiles (accordion: only one expanded at a time)
 *   - Contextual insight line (auto-generated by DashboardService)
 *
 * Data source: DashboardService (interface-injected, backed by real or mock
 * DashboardRepository depending on VITE_USE_MOCK_DATA).
 *
 * Accordion behavior:
 *   by DashboardService, not recomputed separately.
 */
